  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7b17c5ab-5d33-5186-8f0a-4c3143223864" activityNameId="d30dc6c4-4887-57d8-881b-c4b729389c44" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Panel components, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Panel components, at plant
Data are based on information in a US-EPA LCA study about LCD and CRT production. The data represent the respective efforts for a 15-inch LCD computer screen, as it is produced in Japan.;
UUID: 32c22570-83a1-3f25-a2fb-9943fbdac093
This module includes the material and energy efforts as well as the related emissions (air/water) and waste amounts for the production of polarizer, liquid crystals as well as the patternin of color filters on the LCD panel. Estimations for infrastructure and transport of the raw materials are included as well. 
Location: Data from literature (based on information from Japanese producers) – used as data for the global production average
Technology: Current technology in Japan
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature &amp; own estimations 
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_32c22570-83a1-3f25-a2fb-9943fbdac093.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
